 175:Middlewares/LVGL/GUI/lvgl/src/misc/lv_mem.c **** /**
 176:Middlewares/LVGL/GUI/lvgl/src/misc/lv_mem.c ****  * Reallocate a memory with a new size. The old content will be kept.
