 178:Middlewares/LVGL/GUI/lvgl/src/misc/lv_mem.c ****  * Its content will be copied to the new memory block and freed
 179:Middlewares/LVGL/GUI/lvgl/src/misc/lv_mem.c ****  * @param new_size the desired new size in byte
 180:Middlewares/LVGL/GUI/lvgl/src/misc/lv_mem.c ****  * @return pointer to the new memory
